与风险把控。\n7. 负责产品化稳定性建设：自动标定、状态监控、碰撞检测、安全保护、异常恢复、断点续作，支撑设备7*24h无人值守稳定运行。\n8. 负责项目需求拆解、方案落地、测试验收、现场调试、客户交付，输出全套技术文档、调试规范、验收标准。\n9. 统筹算法、软件、结构、测试、供应商多方协同，保障项目按期交付与迭代优化。","Require":"1. 本科及以上，自动化、机器人、机电、计算机相关专业，3年以上机器人集成、设备开发、自动化项目落地经验。\n2. 熟练机械臂、末端设备SDK二次开发，具备多品牌设备适配、接口封装、系统架构搭建经验。\n3. 熟悉主流机器人通信总线与协议，能独立排查通信卡顿、丢包、同步异常问题。\n4. 有实机调试、现场交付、问题定位能力，擅长工程落地、稳定性优化、标准化沉淀。\n5. 具备车载设备、自动化测试设备、工业机器人落地经验优先。","ClassificationOne":"AI工程序列","ClassificationTwo":"智能语音创新发展","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-11T18:08:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null}],"Total":0}